% VALID certificate: min x s.t. 1 <= x <= 5 proves the lower bound 1. The checkers read the comment lines in the
% CON and DER sections below as the beginning of a constraint: "% Lower bound" made them loop forever, the comment
% without blank after % took the sense from the next line and so skipped C2, and "% Gap closed" failed.
VER 1.1
VAR 1
x
INT 0
OBJ min
1 0 1
CON 2 0
% Lower bound
C1 G 1 1 0 1
%upper
C2 L 5 1 0 1
RTP range 1 inf
SOL 0
DER 1
% Gap closed by D1
D1 G 1 OBJ { lin 1 0 1 } -1
